WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:05.508
"I can't have a party," said Toad.

2
00:00:05.509 --> 00:00:08.126
"I'm eating my breakfast."

3
00:00:08.127 --> 00:00:11.890
Toad sipped his coffee.

4
00:00:11.891 --> 00:00:15.625
"Don't be foolish, Toad," said Badger.

5
00:00:15.626 --> 00:00:18.596
"The party will be tonight.

6
00:00:18.597 --> 00:00:21.966
You need to write invitations."

7
00:00:21.967 --> 00:00:25.245
"Now?" asked Toad.

8
00:00:25.246 --> 00:00:28.640
"Yes," ordered Badger.

9
00:00:28.641 --> 00:00:33.280
"Sit down and write to all your friends."

10
00:00:33.281 --> 00:00:38.069
"It's my first day home!" yelled Toad.

11
00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:42.651
"I don't want to sit inside all day."

12
00:00:42.652 --> 00:00:48.501
Suddenly Toad smiled and his eyes twinkled.

13
00:00:48.502 --> 00:00:52.054
"Great idea, Badger," he said.

14
00:00:52.055 --> 00:00:56.122
"I'll mail the invitations by lunch."

15
00:00:56.123 --> 00:01:03.022
Badger was suddenly suspicious.

16
00:01:03.023 --> 00:01:08.231
"Toad, what are you up to?" asked Badger.

17
00:01:08.232 --> 00:01:13.679
"Nothing, dear Badger!" said Toad happily.

18
00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:17.413
"Go and buy food for the party."

19
00:01:17.414 --> 00:01:22.902
As soon as Badger left, Toad sat at the table.

20
00:01:22.903 --> 00:01:26.840
"A party will be just the thing," he said.

21
00:01:26.841 --> 00:01:31.110
"I can tell everyone about my adventures!"

22
00:01:31.111 --> 00:01:35.044
Toad worked hard on his invitations.

23
00:01:35.045 --> 00:01:39.919
On each card he wrote the events for the party:

24
00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.886
[i@1. SPEECHES (by TOAD)@i]

25
00:01:43.887 --> 00:01:48.885
[i@A talk about prison life and fast cars@i]

26
00:01:48.886 --> 00:01:54.005
[i@2. STORIES (told by TOAD)@i]

27
00:01:54.006 --> 00:01:59.503
[i@How the brave Toad fought the Chief Weasel@i]

28
00:01:59.504 --> 00:02:04.880
[i@3. SONGS (sung by TOAD)@i]

29
00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:11.022
[i@"Clever Toad!" and other songs by the talented Toad@i]

30
00:02:11.023 --> 00:02:15.491
Toad was very pleased with his invitations.

31
00:02:15.492 --> 00:02:21.733
"This will be a great party!" he said.

